quiry (model-driven) and governance (state-committed). This design prevents models from subverting the research record by ensuring that only valid, rule-compliant transitions are committed to durable history.", "title": "Mechanical Accountability in WAKE Architecture"}], "retrieval_triggers": ["material belief revision or retraction", "new contradiction or counterevidence", "high-consequence decision", "request for justification", "sign that an excerpt may hide a material distinction"]}}, "prev_hash": "3db6130b383995a1571d47559e42dd66913f771ffaa4fcb797060226325dcc5a", "hash": "82ed3be987fc11b9de3d80cab8761b70eb15bcd5fc6310f3cf970f824704be46"}, {"seq": 3068, "time": "2026-10-29T03:44:43.718460+00:00", "kind": "observation", "payload": {"actor": "runtime", "content": "{\"base_version\":19,\"inherited_commitments\":[],\"invocation\":\"w-5bf0113208314cff\",\"previous_head\":\"4459c81fade761a046144facd7a57b59e1654a1844071476ac56e380eb2be0a4\",\"process_id\":2616,\"scope\":\"Receipt proves state delivery to the provider boundary, not model comprehension.\"}", "id": "r-5bf0113208314cff", "source": "runtime:continuity"}, "prev_hash": "4459c81fade761a046144facd7a57b59e1654a1844071476ac56e380eb2be0a4", "hash": "3db6130b383995a1571d47559e42dd66913f771ffaa4fcb797060226325dcc5a"}, {"seq": 3067, "time": "2026-10-29T03:43:43.955087+00:00", "kind": "temporal_observed", "payload": {"cycle_distance": 0, "effective_elapsed_seconds": 976.399126, "effective_scale": 1.0, "effective_seconds_total": 142024.358794, "intervening_events": {"accepted": 0, "attention_assessed": 0, "failed": 0, "observation": 1, "rejected": 0, "research_collected": 0, "squirrel_assessed": 0, "total": 11}, "observed_at": "2026-10-29T03:43:39.902418+00:00", "previous_anchor_time": "2026-10-29T03:27:23.503292+00:00", "regime_id": "reg-df573bb03399f050", "wall_elapsed_seconds": 976.399126}, "prev_hash": "c3eeeaf9d941dd011479d52ad820d99ad99b30f220bdf2b7d3b3050814731095", "hash": "4459c81fade761a046144facd7a57b59e1654